# ==============================================================================
# SSH hardening drop-in (roles/sshd) - MANAGED BY ANSIBLE, DO NOT EDIT.
# ==============================================================================
# Key-only SSH administration for this Remnawave node host.
#
# The file lives in sshd_config.d/ and is named `00-` on purpose: sshd keeps the
# FIRST value obtained for a keyword and the main sshd_config Includes this
# directory, so `00-` wins over a provider drop-in (e.g. 50-cloud-init.conf).
# The role does not rely on that ordering: it verifies the EFFECTIVE
# configuration with `sshd -T` and reverts this file when it did not take.
#
# Password logins are closed on every path: `PasswordAuthentication` (the ssh
# auth method) and `KbdInteractiveAuthentication` (PAM keyboard-interactive,
# which otherwise still accepts a password). Root SSH is off by design: the
# `ansible` service account is the node's only SSH identity, and root stays
# reachable through the provider console and `sudo`.
# ==============================================================================

PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PermitRootLogin {{ sshd_permit_root_login }}
